{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261114/photo/bkn-20261114083120289-1114_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261114112409\"/><p>秀茂坪有塌樹傷人。今晨(14日)7時49分，一名女子途經康寧道近和康徑交界時，斜坡上一棵樹木的樹椏突然折斷墮下，擊中女子腳部，途人聞呼叫聲發現事件並代為報案。女子腳部受傷骨折，清醒由救護車送往聯合醫院治理，消防接報到場架起升降台，將有危險樹椏移除，其後由相關部門人員清理善後。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T03:38:53.176042+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T00:31:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T04:12:51.077324+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T03:32:21.292758+00:00","content_hash":"839ea6b2551fbc79eea57bb5483aba3eeeb6f7a4187acbdbaebae58f714a30c6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}